      "evidence": [
        "Google has rolled back its new AI tool that allowed people to create fake images on top of its satellite imagery",
        "Less than 48 hours after the tech giant announced the integration of its AI image generator Nano Banana 2 into Google Earth, it said it was pausing the feature"
      ],
      "confidence": 1.0
    },
